# Dependencies

What we **ship** reaches users. What we **build with** stays in this repo. Do not undo the v10 runtime diet.

Trust tiers for library code: [security.mdc](security.mdc). CI audit job: [ci.mdc](ci.mdc).

## Categories

| Kind | Where | What belongs |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Workspace | package `dependencies` | Other `@ethereumjs/*`. Versioned and published together. |
| Crypto | package `dependencies` | Noble (`@noble/*`, `@scure/base`) only. Pure JS by default. |
| Runtime helpers | package `dependencies` | Small, reviewed libs (events, debug). Keep the set short. |
| Opt-in backends | package `devDependencies` or caller-supplied | WASM crypto, KZG, `customCrypto`. Never the default path. |
| Language and types | root `devDependencies` | TypeScript for the build. A second TS only when a tool cannot use the primary (TypeDoc). |
| Lint and format | root `devDependencies` | ESLint, typescript-eslint, Biome. |
| Test | root `devDependencies` | Vitest, coverage, browser/Playwright, CodSpeed. |
| Docs and examples | root `devDependencies` | TypeDoc, embedme, snippet highlighting. |
| Repo scripts | root `devDependencies` | tsx, lockfile lint, package.json sort. |
| CI actions | `.github/workflows/` | Third-party Actions, pinned to a commit SHA. Local actions stay under `.github/actions/`. |
| Archived | `archive/*/package.json.stale` | Frozen. Not a live manifest. Not an audit or inventory source. |

Deprecated `wallet`: no new runtime deps ([security.mdc](security.mdc) S4).

## Update practice

Add a row when a new habit sticks. Do not paste package inventories here.

| Change | Practice |
| --- | --- |
| New runtime dependency | Explicit human ask. Default answer is no. Prefer a bump of a library already in the category. |
| Shipped range bump | Same commit as the lockfile. Note user-facing bumps in CHANGELOG ([releases.mdc](releases.mdc)). |
| Dev toolchain bump | Dependabot or an explicit bump. A dev-only advisory is classified, not forced onto a library release. |
| npm advisory | Classify **runtime vs dev** and **active vs deprecated/archive** before a root `overrides` entry. |
| CI gate | `npm audit --omit=dev --audit-level=high` (runtime tree). |
| Install cooldown | Root `.npmrc`: `min-release-age=3` for third parties in **this** repo. `@ethereumjs/*` is excluded so same-day publish smokes work. Downstream installs do not inherit it. |
| GitHub Actions | Pin the commit SHA. Bump by changing that SHA. |
| `legacy-peer-deps` | On while typescript-eslint cannot peer TypeScript 7 (see `.npmrc`). Drop the flag and the extra explicit peers when that peer range allows it. |

## Do not

- Add a runtime dependency without an explicit human ask.
- Add a second crypto stack, or turn WASM / `customCrypto` on by default.
- `npm audit fix --force`, or a blanket `overrides` entry, to go green.
- Treat `archive/*/package.json.stale` as installed or current.
